debian-config-sshd (1.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial release of debian-config-sshd package.
  * Add /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/99-hardening.conf drop-in configuration.
  * Restrict SSH access to members of the ssh-users system group.
  * Enforce Lynis SSH hardening recommendations (root login, timeouts, auth attempts).
  * Add postinst logic to create ssh-users group, validate sshd syntax, and reload service via invoke-rc.d.
  * Add postrm logic to safely handle package removal and notify sysadmin on purge.
    (Closes: #100000)

